/[Bb]uilds/
**/[Bb]uilds/

# Logs
/[Ll]ogs/
**/[Ll]ogs/

# User-specific settings
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
**/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/

# Memory & recording captures
/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
**/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
/[Rr]ecordings/
**/[Rr]ecordings/

